From 4a2e8982e15f7a65c701ec844b843f0bee2da0f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reid W <westwood.reid@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:08:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] migrate 15 self-named bindings to qualified references

The exact route refuses `in X = X` as SI_SELF_BINDING: the right-hand name
resolves to the calc's own formal, so the plant attribute's value never
reaches the calculation. Legal SysML, silently inert.

Each of the 15 sites gains a qualifier on the right-hand side only; no calc
def formal is renamed, so no generated schema field or entry-point key
changes name:

- ife_plant.sysml (10) + hif_driver.sysml (2): the declaring part def --
  'IFE Power Plant'::attr, 'HIF Driver'::attr
- hif_plant.sysml (3): the enclosing part usage -- hif_plant::attr

Verified against sysml-codegen at 9ce5548 (licensed live extraction):

- generates and seals with no diagnostic; snapshot capture succeeds
- 23 entry points, 8 calc modules, 9 published channels
- entry-point key set and every value are IDENTICAL to the ratified D-5
  rename migration of the codegen fixture; the only delta is the 4
  hif_driver_instance keys, the workaround this repo deleted in July
- live and --from-snapshot packages are byte-identical

The 9-channel count confirms what was previously only inferred from July's
7->6 module delta on deleting hif_driver_instance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 models/designs/generic_ife/ife_plant.sysml | 20 ++++++++++----------
 models/designs/hif_ife/hif_driver.sysml    |  4 ++--
 models/designs/hif_ife/hif_plant.sysml     |  6 +++---
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

